gated_output":"all n (222, 2456) total variance 87.09613216090071 PC1 eigen 49.18467059349376 pct 56.47170473957488\nfirst 5 ratios all [56.47170474 13.51953938  7.21637964  2.77694864  2.43716034]\nsum ev all / total 1.0000000000000009 ncomp min 221\nunique n (178, 2456) total variance 88.62882166365958 PC1 eigen 49.60657093029389 pct 55.97115024111174\nfirst 5 ratios unique [55.97115024 14.12924436  6.89687009  2.86282891  2.55785693]\nsum ev unique / total 0.9999999999999993 ncomp min 177\navg groups n (199, 2456) pct 55.80990427532062\nfirst5 avg [55.80990428 14.05007269  6.99495154  2.81057537  2.56609946]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport csv, numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import PCA\nwith open('inputs/ROSMAP_genexp_ad.csv', newline='') as f:\n    r=csv.reader(f); h=next(r); rows=list(r)\nX=np.array([[float(x) for x in row[1:]] for row in rows], float).T\nY=np.log10(X+1)\nfor solver in ['auto','full','randomized']:\n    pca=PCA(n_components=100, svd_solver=solver, random_state=0)\n    pca.fit(Y)\n    print(solver, 'ratio0', pca.explained_variance_ratio_[0]*100, 'ev0', pca.explained_variance_[0], 'total', pca.explained_variance_.sum() if hasattr(pca,'explained_variance_') else None)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
